So for example we have the following task.

01:37.140 --> 01:41.980
It is very simple which categories contribute the most to the overall sales.

01:41.980 --> 01:43.940
So now let's go and do it step by step.

01:43.940 --> 01:46.580
So first we're going to go and collect the informations.

01:46.580 --> 01:48.060
So we need the category.

01:48.060 --> 01:50.140
We need the sales amount.

01:50.540 --> 01:59.220
