02:20.520 --> 02:24.160
And we are grouping up the data by the category.

02:24.160 --> 02:25.520
So this is basics.

02:25.520 --> 02:28.800
Right now we have the total sales for each of those categories.

02:28.840 --> 02:33.640
Now in order to calculate the percentage we need to measures the total sales for each category.

02:33.640 --> 02:35.280
And we have it here already.

02:35.280 --> 02:40.040
