05:08.000 --> 05:11.160
And with that we are converting the whole thing to a string.

05:11.160 --> 05:12.960
So we're going to do concatenation.

05:12.960 --> 05:18.820
So concat at the start and go to the end and let's add the percentage character.

05:18.820 --> 05:24.620
And as well we can go and order the data by the total sales descending.

05:24.620 --> 05:26.460
So let's go and execute it.

05:26.460 --> 05:30.820
So now by looking to the result you can see the category bikes is dominating.

05:30.820 --> 05:34.500
So it is overwhelming top performing the categories.

05:34.500 --> 05:39.380
It is making 69% of the total sales of our business.

05:39.380 --> 05:44.220
So this means my friends most of the business revenue comes from the bikes.

05:44.220 --> 05:49.740
And as you can see their accessories and clothing, they are really minor contributors to our business,

05:49.740 --> 05:51.300
which is not really good.

05:51.300 --> 05:53.300
And this is actually dangerous thing.

05:53.300 --> 05:58.900
If you have like one category dominating your whole business, you are over relying on only one category

05:58.900 --> 05:59.900
on your business.

05:59.900 --> 06:03.820
And if this fails this category, then the whole business is going to fail.

06:03.820 --> 06:10.580
So by looking to this, either the business has to decide removing all those products by those two categories,

06:10.580 --> 06:16.620
or to focus more on bringing more revenue for the products that are inside those two categories.

06:16.620 --> 06:22.080
So as you can see, guys, those insights are really amazing for the business and helps the managers

06:22.080 --> 06:27.800
and the decision makers to understand what is going on quickly and make very critical decisions.

06:27.840 --> 06:30.640
And now you can see as well from the results perfectly.

06:30.640 --> 06:30.960
Why?

06:30.960 --> 06:36.200
The part to whole analysis is very important because by just looking to those numbers, it's going to

06:36.200 --> 06:40.160
be really hard to understand the importance of the categories.

06:40.160 --> 06:46.440
But seeing the data as a percentage, how each category is contributing to the whole sales of the business

06:46.480 --> 06:52.000
